  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed dwelling would not provide satisfactory living conditions for current and/or future occupiers of the units of accommodation due to a failure to provide adequate noise mitigation. The proposal is therefore contrary to policies D3, D6 and D13 of the London Plan 2021 and policies DM10 and DM13 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The application has not been accompanied by a completed Statutory Biodiversity Metric, including the Small Sites Metric, or sufficient supporting information to demonstrate whether the development is exempt from mandatory Biodiversity Net Gain requirements or, if not exempt, how the required 10% Biodiversity Net Gain would be achieved. The proposal therefore fails to demonstrate that biodiversity impacts would be appropriately assessed, mitigated and compensated, contrary to Schedule 7A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, Policy G6 of the London Plan 2021 and Policy DM6 of the Kingston Core Strategy 2012."
  ],
